=== Greenwood Zipper Examples ===

--- Navigation ---
down → Section(Introduction)
down_last → Section(Editing)
right → Section(Navigation)
left → Section(Introduction)
nth_child(2) → Section(Navigation)
deep focus → Paragraph(Hello world)
up_until(Document) → Document
right_until(Editing) → Section(Editing)
right_n_until(2 sections) → Section(Editing)

--- Editing ---
insert_right: now 4 sections
insert_left: now 4 sections
insert_down: focus now on → Paragraph(Inserted child)
  parent children: 4
before delete: focus on → Section(Navigation)
after delete: focus on → Section(Editing)
  remaining sections: 2
set_focus heading → Heading(Replaced!)

--- Search ---
find_descendant(Paragraph) → Paragraph(Hello world)
find in Navigation section → Paragraph(Zippers provide cursors)
